WEBVTT

00:08:27.401 --> 00:08:30.239
when I remembered that my firm

00:08:30.239 --> 00:08:33.498
offers to match the charitable contributions

00:08:33.498 --> 00:08:36.241
its employees make.

00:08:36.241 --> 00:08:38.967
So think of this:

00:08:38.967 --> 00:08:41.254
Instead of just being able to help Dorothy

00:08:41.254 --> 00:08:43.960
and four of her classmates

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.240
to go through secondary school for a few years,

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:50.544
I was able to double my contribution.

00:08:50.544 --> 00:08:52.957
Brilliant.

00:08:52.957 --> 00:08:58.920
So following that conversation with my daughter,

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:01.557
and seeing the absence of inflation